{"file_id":"BRIEFING_FILES_BLOCK_052110","resource_class":"BRIEFING_NBE","status":"TRANSLATED_PENDING_CSV_MERGE","translations":[{"unique_index":0,"cn_text":"Huey把那架大得离谱的无人直升机叫作Chrysalis吧。这个名字也和AI的代号有关吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":105,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":1,"cn_text":"嗯，就是TJ-chrysalis6000。这也是“蛹”的意思。其他还有GW-pupa5000、TR-cocoon7000……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":109,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":2,"cn_text":"原来如此，一个是气垫型，一个是履带型啊。……TJ、GW这些也是首字母吗？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":100,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":3,"cn_text":"对。就是肖像刻在拉什莫尔山上的那些历任美国总统。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":72,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":4,"cn_text":"那就少了一个人。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":24,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":5,"cn_text":"那个分给Reptile Pod的AI了。是AL-aurelia8000。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":54,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":6,"cn_text":"aurelia……“羽化前最后阶段的蛹”吗。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":52,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":7,"cn_text":"说到底，除了“BS”以外的首字母都是Coldman的个人喜好。我本来想从历史悠久的英国王室里取。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":126,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":8,"cn_text":"MS、AV、EW……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":21,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":9,"cn_text":"……是什么的缩写？","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":27,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":10,"cn_text":"还不明白吗？Mary Stuart、Alexandrina Victoria、Elizabeth Windsor……。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":81,"review_flag":""},{"unique_index":11,"cn_text":"……不全都是女王吗。","cn_control_tokens":"","cn_utf8_bytes":30,"review_flag":""}]}